WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：你给我跳个舞吧
You: Dance for me

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.740
好呀。看咪的。
Dance? Okay. Watch Mii.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.400
哒哒，Mii跳舞啦！
Ta-da, Mii dances!
哒哒，Mii跳舞啦！
Ta-da, Mii dances!

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.150
Mii做得好吗？
Did Mii do good?
Mii做得好吗？
Did Mii do good?

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.790
你：可爱可爱，我们去看电影吧
You: So cute! Let's go see a movie

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:52.100
咪可爱是当然的。
Mii is cute. Obviously.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.210
电影时间。咪占好座位了。
Movie time. Mii saved seats.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.750
咪陪你一起看。
Mii will watch with you.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.340
你：让咪去买爆米花
You: Send Mate to buy popcorn

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.440
爆米花？咪去拿。
Popcorn? Mii will get it.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.460
咪买来了。全是咪一个人买的。
Mii bought it. All by Mii.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.300
我没吃。也许吃了一颗。
I ate none. Maybe one.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.890
你：我们去游乐园玩吧
You: Let's go to the amusement park

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.790
游乐园？好呀！
Amusement park? Yes!

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:49.550
咪在骑。很小心。
Mii is riding. Carefully.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:54.740
再来一次？咪说好。
Again? Mii says yes.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.440
你：一起去坐摩天轮
You: Let's ride the Ferris wheel together

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:00.400
摩天轮？咪准备好了。
Ferris wheel? Mii is ready.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:10.570
你看，我们好高。
Look. We are so high.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.400
咪会靠近你。
Mii will stay close.

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.990
你：我们去跳伞吧
You: Let's go skydiving

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.490
跳伞？咪很勇敢。
Skydiving? Mii is brave.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.430
咪检查过了。检查了两遍。
Mii checked it. Twice.

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:36.930
跳！咪在飞！
Jump! Mii is flying!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.540
你：伸手去接住降落的咪
You: Reach out and catch Mate as it comes down

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:44.880
伸手吧，咪要降落啦！
Reach out. Mii is coming down!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.510
接住咪啦！咪落地了。
Caught me! Mii landed.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:03.510
好暖和。咪没事。
So warm. Mii is fine.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:03.090
你：我们去骑马吧
You: Let's go horseback riding

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:06.730
骑马？咪准备好了。
Riding? Mii is ready.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:18.070
咪上来了。好高哦。
Mii is up. Very high.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.190
驾！请慢一点。
Giddy up! Slowly, please.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.640
你：这匹马也太小了吧，换一匹大一点的，跑起来！
You: This horse is way too small. Get a bigger one and let it run!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:30.170
小？咪是计划好的。
Too small? Mii planned this.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.890
快点！咪在飞！
Faster! Mii is flying!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.200
大马，大风，好了。
Big horse. Big wind. Okay.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:48.190
你：棒棒！我们现在去滑雪吧
You: Awesome! Let's go skiing now

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:52.290
滑雪？咪准备好了。
Skiing? Mii is ready.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:06.100
咪在滑雪！快看！
Mii is skiing! Look!

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:08.120
咪就是想这样停下的。
Mii meant to stop. Like that.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.740
你：我们去潜水吧
You: Let's go diving

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:14.190
潜水？咪准备好了。
Diving? Mii is ready.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.920
鱼！咪摸到鱼了！
Fish! Mii touched a fish!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:33.580
咪发现了个秘密。你看！
Mii found a secret. Look!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.290
你：我们去打猎吧
You: Let's go hunting

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.360
猎？咪准备好了。
Hunting? Mii is ready.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.500
没中。是靶子动了。
Missed. The target moved.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.920
明白了！Mii很会打猎。
Got it! Mii hunts well.
明白了！Mii很会打猎。
Got it! Mii hunts well.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.840
你：我们去飙车吧
You: Let's go street racing

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.480
准备好了，咪来飙车。
Racing? Mii is ready.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:12.600
咪在飙车！好快！
Mii is racing! So fast!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.730
咪是故意停下的。
Mii stopped on purpose.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.390
你：怎么只有你自己，要和其他小伙伴一起飙车比赛，我给你加油
You: Why are you all alone? Go race with the other little buddies, I'll cheer you on

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:23.810
只有咪自己？咪需要对手。
Only me? Mii needs rivals.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.820
对手？咪不怕。
Rivals? Mii is not scared.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:40.740
我赢了！再大声点加油！
I won! Cheer louder!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.940
你：要不你们几个再比一轮摩托车
You: Why don't you guys have another motorcycle race?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.470
摩托车？咪准备好了。
Motorcycles? Mii is ready.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:57.720
咪在比赛！好险！
Mii is racing! So close!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.810
咪是让小鸭赢的。
Mii let the duck win.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.490
你：我们去滑冰吧
You: Let's go ice skating

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:08.260
咪准备好了，滑冰！
Skating? Mii is ready.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:19.650
咪在滑冰！你看！
Mii is skating! Look!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:24.290
咪是故意转圈的。
Mii spun on purpose.
